    <div class="card">
      <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">Only one of % value, flat amount, formula, slab or
         status rule applies per row — the rest lock automatically. Manual calculation supports
         parentheses and system values (calendar days, working days, and # Hours capped by the Max
         OT hours set on Overtime Pay). <b>Basis Employee status</b> checks PCC Status, DRA Status,
         PAN or National ID, which are real columns on <code>employees</code>: a rule against a
