    <p class="note"><b>A device user id that maps to no employee is reported and NOT imported.</b>
       Not attached to a plausible-looking employee, and not silently dropped: an unmapped punch
       is somebody who worked and will not be paid for it, and a mis-mapped one pays the wrong
       person. Record the enrolment number against the employee and import the same file again
       &mdash; re-importing never doubles anybody's attendance, because a punch is identified by its
       device, person, instant and direction rather than by which file it arrived in.</p>
