      <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0">An employee follows the most specific schedule whose Applies-to fields all match (a named Employee first, then the one narrowing by more fields; a tie goes to the lower number) &mdash; everyone else follows Schedule 1. Attendance, leave days and payroll all read it.</p>
      <p style="margin:10px 0 0"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" id="hc-add" onclick="var b=document.getElementById('hc-new');b.hidden=false;document.getElementById('hc-new-on').value='1';this.hidden=true;b.querySelector('input[type=text]').focus({preventScroll:false});"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Add W.OFF schedule</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" name="save_part" value="woff"><i class="fas fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save W.OFF schedule</button> <span class="note">Saves the weekly-off ticks above (the holidays below are kept as they are).</span></p>
      <style>
        .hc-sched { border: 2px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-top: 14px; }
        .hc-sched-h { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
