        <div><label for="lfield">Detail field</label>
          <input id="lfield" name="detail_field" placeholder="grade"></div>
        <div><label for="lvalue">Value</label>
          <input id="lvalue" name="detail_value" placeholder="M2"></div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end">
          <button class="go" type="submit">Record</button></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0">The ordering is the platform's, not this screen's: an
         employee begins by joining, nothing follows an exit, nobody resigns twice, and a
         promotion, transfer, resignation or exit each carry a reason &mdash; because a change to
