    }
?>
    <div class="problem" style="margin-bottom:12px">
      <b>These figures come from a SYNTHETIC pack and are not law.</b> Jurisdiction
      <code>IN-ZZ</code> does not exist and the “authority” is this repository. Phase 6 is recorded
      as <b>blocked, not failed</b>: the machinery below is finished and proven, and the real rates
