// WHAT THE FILTER SHOWS IS WHAT A DOWNLOAD / ACTION GETS (owner, 8 Oct): a
// sample, export or bulk action on a screen carries the filter as hidden f_*
// fields — the filter last APPLIED. Picking a branch and pressing "Download
